<title>UK: SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH PREMIER LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH PREMIER LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Northern Ireland</p>
<p>premier league soccer matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> Ards	     0   Glenavon     0</p>
<p> Crusaders	2   Glentoran    0</p>
<p> Linfield	 1   Cliftonville 1</p>
<p> Portadown	2   Coleraine    2</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> Coleraine		 5  4  1  0  10   6  13</p>
<p> Linfield		  5  2  2  1   7   4   8</p>
<p> Crusaders		 5  2  2  1   9   7   8</p>
<p> Portadown		 5  2  2  1   8   7   8</p>
<p> Cliftonville	    5  1  3  1   4   4   6</p>
<p> Glenavon		  5  1  2  2   6   9   5</p>
<p> Glentoran		 5  1  1  3   9  11   4</p>
<p> Ards			5  0  1  4   5  10   1</p>
